    <item>
      <title>About Me</title>
      <link>//localhost:1313/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>//localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;hi-d&#34;&gt;Hi :D&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If I could choose one word to describe myself, I would say that I am &lt;strong&gt;curious&lt;/strong&gt;. I find purpose in understanding why, whether it be why something works, why something doesn&amp;rsquo;t work, or just why I do things. I would describe my outlook on life as &lt;strong&gt;reasonably optimistic&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ndash; hope for the best, prepare for the worst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;background&#34;&gt;Background&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I chose to study at the &lt;strong&gt;Olin College of Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; because because of its collaborative and project-based courses, which allow me to exercise creativity and autonomy. I enjoy taking ownership over my projects and developing a broader systems perspective. The people here are amazing; they &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; about learning and going above and beyond, not just doing the bare minimum.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
